<title>SYRIA: Syria offers 9,500 tonnes of lentils for sale.</title>
<headline>Syria offers 9,500 tonnes of lentils for sale.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) has offered 9,500 tonnes of lentils for export, an official spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>December 16 was set as the final date for receiving bids. Results would be announced on December 17.</p>
